    {
      "question": "How does CSOAI harness the mastra framework as an OWEM clan?",
      "answer": "Framework: mastra. Clan ID: clan-mastra. Language: typescript. Best for: TypeScript-first agent framework with 4-tier memory. Key features: .network() method — any agent becomes a routing agent; 4-tier memory: message history, working memory, semantic recall, RAG; Replit Agent 3 uses it (80% → 96% task success). Joining strategy: Wire Mastra agents into sov-training-honey as a router — every Mastra agent becomes a peer in the swarm. Audience match: TS-heavy CSOAI stack (Next.js, React). Use case: agent_routing. Routing path: src/mastra/.",
