      "answer": "Terminal command: `curl -s https://csoai.org/api/v1/ai-systems | head -20` ran successful in /Users/nicholas. Phlabet glyphs: governance, authority, network, law, cross-jurisdiction, surveillance, detection, watchdog. Captured by SOV TUI Snooper.",
