      "question": "What repos does the CSOAI sovereign org contain?",
      "answer": "CSOAI has 100 repos in its sovereign org.\nEach repo is part of the IWM at scale 24 (cluster).\n\ncsoai-static-deploy2: ?\ncsoai-dashboard: ?\nflywheel-nsite: ?\ncorpus-watch: ?\nsovos-core: ?\noci-sovos-governance: ?\ncsoai-mcp-dist: ?\nawesome-mcp-servers-csoai: ?\nsovereign-oowm: ?\ndatabase-universal-mcp: ?\ncalendar-ai-mcp: ?\ncsoai-governance: ?\ncitation-finder-ai-mcp: ?\nmeok-governance-smithery: ?\nreal-estate-listing-mcp: ?\nmeok-compliance-gateway: ?\nhtml-parser-ai-mcp: ?\nchurn-predictor-ai-mcp: ?\nresume-parser-ai-mcp: ?\ndependency-updater-ai-mcp: ?",
