      "question": "How does the SOVOS Think pipeline work?",
      "answer": "Pipeline: 1) Compress query to Phlabet, 2) Spine think() through 10 GNN layers, 3) Select model plan via meta-cognition, 4) Calculate confidence, 5) If <0.95, escalate to children (boxed recursion), 6) Draw J-Space cards relevant to task type, 7) Apply card effects. Last run: confidence=1.00, model_plan=[\"kimi-k3\", \"claude-opus-5\"]. 60 cards drawn for governance task. Axis Governance weighted 2.0.",
