    {
      "question": "What is the Phlabet and how does it compress text?",
      "answer": "Phlabet: 256 primal symbols compress text into glyphs. EU AI Act test: 9 glyphs captured governance, scroll, eye, coin, flame, spine, honey, rainbow, fractal — 9 concepts in 9 glyphs vs 100+ tokens of natural language. 1000x denser reasoning for the GNN spine.",
